description.en:
A fixed version of the original Microsoft Store that works without WebView

# Installation

1. Perform Interop Unlock;
2. Uninstall the original Store (if it can't be removed from the context menu, uninstall it using Interop Tools);
3. Wait a minute or two;
4. Install the app

